OL,3,GNEWSAHow families are cutting the cost
OL,4,Aof Halloween as spending grows
OL,5,
OL,6,FHalloween has become one of the UK's
OL,7,Fbiggest seasonal celebrations, with
OL,8,Fspending on costumes, decorations and
OL,9,Fthemed events continuing to grow.
OL,11,FAs a mum, I have already found myself
OL,12,Fbuying three costumes for different
OL,13,FHalloween occasions this year. For many
OL,14,Ffamilies, the costs can add up quickly.
OL,16,FThat is why some parents say they are
OL,17,Fincreasingly turning to costume swaps,
OL,18,Fsecond-hand outfits and homemade
OL,19,Fcreations rather than buying new every
OL,20,Fyear.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
