OL,3,GNEWSAHow families are cutting the cost
OL,4,Aof Halloween as spending grows
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarlier this month, businesses told the
OL,7,FBBC that Halloween had become more
OL,8,Fimportant than Christmas for some
OL,9,Fattractions and retailers, while a
OL,10,Fsurvey found 36% of shoppers planned to
OL,11,Fcelebrate Halloween this year, up from
OL,12,F27% in 2025.
